Scoped colorbalance video filter

The option table (rs, gs, bs, rm, gm, bm, rh, gh, bh, pl), pix_fmts,
get_component, hfun, preservel, the rgba_map byte offsets and the 8-bit slice
functions color_balance8 and color_balance8_p (single-precision float per
pixel, lrintf and av_clip_uint8) in src/video-ops/colorbalance.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_colorbalance.c (colorbalance_options, pix_fmts, get_component,
hfun, preservel, color_balance8, color_balance8_p, config_output,
filter_frame).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
